{"sha": "1b3761abfd1b8539f3a60f800e0474fe23605036e1f694255067018e1b0dafde", "body": ["在氟化氢中，氢的 1s 轨道与能量低得多的", "氟的 2p 轨道相遇。只有沿轴向的 $2\\mathrm p_z$ 具有正确的对称性：它形成", "以氟为主的 $\\sigma$ 成键轨道，以及以", "氢为主的 $\\sigma^*$ 反键轨道。氟的 $2\\mathrm p_x$ 和 $2\\mathrm p_y$ 轨道保持", "非键：它们是氟的孤电子对。键的极化偏向氟。", "", "一氧化碳与 \\ce{N2} 具有相同的 10 个价电子，图样也相似，", "但氧的轨道能级更低。其成键轨道以氧为主；", "其最高占据轨道是以碳为主的 $\\sigma$ 轨道，", "即碳上的孤电子对。因此，一氧化碳通过碳与金属结合", "（见\\cref{ch:b2:coordination-complexes}）。", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small]", "  % CO schematic: C left (higher), O right (lower)", "  \\pic (c2s) at (0,0.6) {omlevel={ud}{0.8}}; \\node[left] at (-0.5,0.6) {2s};", "  \\pic (c2p1) at (-0.45,2.6) {omlevel={u}{0.4}}; \\pic (c2p2) at (0,2.6) {omlevel={u}{0.4}}; \\pic (c2p3) at (0.45,2.6) {omlevel={empty}{0.4}};", "  \\node[left] at (-0.75,2.6) {2p};", "  \\node at (0,-0.6) {C};", "  \\pic (o2s) at (6,-1.2) {omlevel={ud}{0.8}}; \\node[right] at (6.5,-1.2) {2s};", "  \\pic (o2p1) at (5.55,1.4) {omlevel={ud}{0.4}}; \\pic (o2p2) at (6,1.4) {omlevel={u}{0.4}}; \\pic (o2p3) at (6.45,1.4) {omlevel={u}{0.4}};", "  \\node[right] at (6.75,1.4) {2p};", "  \\node at (6,-2.2) {O};", "  % MOs", "  \\pic (m1) at (3,-1.8) {omlevel={ud}{0.8}};", "  \\pic (m2) at (3,-0.2) {omlevel={ud}{0.8}};", "  \\pic (m3a) at (2.75,0.9) {omlevel={ud}{0.45}}; \\pic (m3b) at (3.25,0.9) {omlevel={ud}{0.45}};", "  \\pic (m4) at (3,1.9) {omlevel={ud}{0.8}};", "  \\pic (m5a) at (2.75,3.3) {omlevel={empty}{0.45}}; \\pic (m5b) at (3.25,3.3) {omlevel={empty}{0.45}};", "  \\pic (m6) at (3,4.4) {omlevel={empty}{0.8}};", "  \\draw[omcorr, densely dashed] (c2s-r) -- (m1-l) (o2s-l) -- (m1-r);", "  \\draw[omcorr, densely dashed] (c2s-r) -- (m2-l) (o2s-l) -- (m2-r);", "  \\draw[omcorr, densely dashed] (c2p3-r) -- (m3a-l) (o2p1-l) -- (m3b-r);", "  \\draw[omcorr, densely dashed] (c2p3-r) -- (m4-l) (o2p1-l) -- (m4-r);", "  \\draw[omcorr, densely dashed] (c2p3-r) -- (m5a-l) (o2p1-l) -- (m5b-r);", "  \\draw[omcorr, densely dashed] (c2p3-r) -- (m6-l) (o2p1-l) -- (m6-r);", "  \\node[omsymlabel, below=0.17cm, inner sep=0.5pt] at (m1-c) {$\\sigma$};", "  \\node[omsymlabel, below=0.17cm, inner sep=0.5pt] at (m2-c) {$\\sigma$};", "  \\node[omsymlabel, below=0.17cm, inner sep=0.5pt] at (3,0.9) {$\\pi$};", "  \\node[omsymlabel, below=0.24cm, inner sep=0.5pt] at (m4-c) {$\\sigma$ (碳上孤电子对)};", "  \\node[omsymlabel, below=0.05cm, inner sep=0.5pt] at (3,3.3) {$\\pi^*$};", "  \\node[omsymlabel, below=0.05cm, inner sep=0.5pt] at (m6-c) {$\\sigma^*$};", "  \\node at (3,-2.6) {CO};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 一氧化碳价轨道示意图：氧的轨道", "能级低于碳的。键级为 3，与 \\ce{N2} 相同；最高占据", "轨道是以碳为主的 $\\sigma$ 轨道，即其孤电子对。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{history}[洪特与马利肯]", "\\begin{minipage}[t]{0.27\\linewidth}", "\\vspace{0pt}", "\\includegraphics[width=\\linewidth]{images/book3/mulliken-hund.jpg}", "\\end{minipage}\\hfill", "\\begin{minipage}[t]{0.69\\linewidth}", "\\vspace{0pt}", "1926 年至 1932 年间，弗里德里希·洪特与罗伯特·马利肯通过", "将每个电子归入整个分子的一条轨道来解释双原子分子的光谱，", "这些轨道按其绕轴的对称性分类。“$\\sigma$”、“$\\pi$”、", "成键与反键等词，以及本章的轨道图，都出自他们的", "工作；马利肯于 1966 年获诺贝尔化学奖。照片展示的是 1929 年在芝加哥的", "马利肯（左）与洪特。（照片：GFHund，CC BY 3.0，", "Wikimedia Commons。）", "\\end{minipage}", "\\end{history}", "", "\\section{电离与键强}", "", "从成键轨道移去一个电子会削弱键；从", "反键轨道移去一个电子则增强键。离子的解离能", "可由热化学循环求得：对于 $\\mathrm{AB}^+ \\to \\mathrm A + \\mathrm B^+$，", "\\[", "  D_0(\\mathrm{AB}^+) = D_0(\\mathrm{AB}) + I(\\mathrm B) - I(\\mathrm{AB}) ,", "\\]", "其中 B 为电离能较低的原子。", "", "\\begin{example}[氮与氧的离子]\\label{ex:b2:diatomic-mos:ions}", "\\ce{N2}（$I = \\qty{15.58}{eV}$）失去一个成键电子：$D_0(\\ce{N2+}) = 9.76 + 14.53 -", "15.58 = \\qty{8.71}{eV}$，弱于 \\ce{N2}。\\ce{O2}（$I = \\qty{12.07}{eV}$）失去一个", "$\\pi^*$ 电子：$D_0(\\ce{O2+}) = 5.12 + 13.62 - 12.07 = \\qty{6.66}{eV}$，强于 \\ce{O2}，", "与键级 2.5 和 2.5 对比 3 和 2 相符。", "% ledger: ie:N2, ie:N, ie:O2, ie:O, janafH0:N, janafH0:O", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{练习}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:diatomic-mos:1}", "对两个氢的 1s 轨道取 $\\alpha = \\qty{-13.6}{eV}$，$\\beta = \\qty{-9.0}{eV}$，", "$S = 0.60$（练习数据）。求 $E_+$ 与 $E_-$，再求", "\\ce{H2} 中两个电子的能量，并与两个独立原子相比较。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:diatomic-mos:2}", "求 \\ce{He2}、\\ce{He2+}、\\ce{Li2} 与 \\ce{B2} 的键级（考虑 s--p", "混合）。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:diatomic-mos:3}", "在 \\ce{B2}、\\ce{C2}、\\ce{N2}、\\ce{O2}、\\ce{F2} 中，哪些是顺磁性的？", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:diatomic-mos:4}", "设分子轴为 $z$。在 (1s, $2\\mathrm p_z$)、(1s,", "$2\\mathrm p_x$)、($2\\mathrm p_x$, $2\\mathrm p_x$)、($2\\mathrm p_x$, $2\\mathrm p_y$)、", "(2s, $2\\mathrm p_z$) 中，哪些对的重叠积分不为零？", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:diatomic-mos:5}", "判断 \\ce{N2+} 的键比 \\ce{N2} 更长还是更短，并用", "本章计算出的解离能加以检验。", "\\end{exercise}", ""]}